    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that just sounds like more work. more exhaustion. why is the \"effort\" worth it if it doesn't actually change anything? it feels less like a journey and more like just... enduring a slow disappearance. it's exhausting to try and make meaning out of something that feels so hollow.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
